  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced. In a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak. Finely chop garlic. Rinse freekeh.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Toast freekeh, stirring occasionally, until golden, 1-2 minutes.\n• Half-fill the saucepan with water, then add a good pinch of salt. Bring to the boil, then simmer, uncovered, until tender, 30-35 minutes.\n• Drain and rinse. Return the pan to medium heat with the butter and garlic. Cook until fragrant, 1 minute. Add freekeh and vegetable stock powder and stir to combine. TIP: The freekeh is cooked when it has softened but still retains some bite.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6459cad42ff15446fa01d0ce/step-77ab689e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the freekeh is cooking, cut tomato into wedges. Cut carrot into bite-sized chunks. Cut zucchini into small chunks.\n• Place the veggies on a lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt and pepper. Toss to coat. Roast until tender, 20-25 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6459cad42ff15446fa01d0ce/step-01b1637c.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the veggies are roasting, roughly chop baby spinach leaves.\n• Cut lime into wedges. Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6459cad42ff15446fa01d0ce/step-1d88be54.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Heat a medium frying pan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Add haloumi to the pan and cook until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Reduce heat to medium and add the honey. Cook until fragrant, turning the haloumi, 1 minute. TIP: Cook haloumi in batches for the best results.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6459cad42ff15446fa01d0ce/step-f68bfa4e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "When the freekeh is cooked, add spinach, roasted veggies and a generous squeeze of lime juice. Toss to combine and season to taste with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6459cad42ff15446fa01d0ce/step-7fcd86e1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide the roast veggie freekeh between bowls.\n• Top with the honey haloumi. Drizzle over dill & parsley mayonnaise and Greek-style yoghurt.\n• Garnish with pepitas to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/6459cad42ff15446fa01d0ce/step-728b7542.jpg"
    }
  ]
}
